S3 checkpoint SPI - missed fieds, client configuration - missed fields, fixed generation of retry policies.&lt;br/&gt;
Cluster communication - removed Discovery startup delay for 2.3.0 version&lt;br/&gt;
Cluster data storage - missed Checkpoint write order.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
